Subject: [PATCH 2/3] docs: a withdrawn claim stays withdrawn; claims match on
 any line

Review of #281: the Add pass re-found a claimant's old claim comment after
they commented unclaim, so Add and Withdraw would flip the label every
run. Add now skips a claim comment its author later withdrew, and AGENTS.md
'Check before claiming' says the same. The pattern now matches a claim on
any line of a comment, as both texts say. 'Claim before any code' keeps
the 4 h stale rule for agent claims only, and 'Pick' drops issues holding
a live contributor claim comment.

